l rung"}]},{"id":"blk-63806","spans":[{"id":"spn-93905","text":"Graphonomous implementation"}]},{"id":"blk-63807","spans":[{"id":"spn-93906","text":"Compliance"}]}],"id":"blk-63804","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-63808","spans":[{"id":"spn-93907","text":"1. alethic ("},{"id":"spn-93908","marks":["code"],"text":"value"},{"id":"spn-93909","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-63809","spans":[{"id":"spn-93910","marks":["code"],"text":"Topology.compute_kappa/2"},{"id":"spn-93911","text":", SCC analysis; node confidence"}]},{"id":"blk-63810","spans":[{"id":"spn-93912","text":"✅ ~90% — κ is a first-class Value"}]}],[{"id":"blk-63811","spans":[{"id":"spn-93913","text":"2. axiological ("},{"id":"spn-93914","marks":["code"],"text":"score"},{"id":"spn-93915","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-63812","spans":[{"id":"spn-93916","marks":["code"],"text":"Coverage.weighted_sum/2"},{"id":"spn-93917","text":", "},{"id":"spn-93918","marks":["code"],"text":"Reranker"}]},{"id":"blk-63813","spans":[{"id":"spn-93919","text":"◻ ~60% — weighted sum, not a "},{"id":"spn-93920","marks":["italic"],"text":"named"},{"id":"spn-93921","text":" semiring"}]}],[{"id":"blk-63814","spans":[{"id":"spn-93922","text":"3. deontic (norm/govern)"}]},{"id":"blk-63815","spans":[{"id":"spn-93923","marks":["code"],"text":"Coverage.pick_decision/4"},{"id":"spn-93924","text":" floor gates (act/learn/escalate)"}]},{"id":"blk-63816","spans":[{"id":"spn-93925","text":"◻ ~70% — floor present, "},{"id":"spn-93926","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-93927","text":" veto implicit"}]}],[{"id":"blk-63817","spans":[{"id":"spn-93928","text":"4. temporal (LTL ▸ supervise)"}]},{"id":"blk-63818","spans":[{"id":"spn-93929","text":"consolidation cadence; freshness/staleness decay"}]},{"id":"blk-63819","spans":[{"id":"spn-93930","text":"◻ ~40% — time-aware, no LTL obligations"}]}],[{"id":"blk-63820","spans":[{"id":"spn-93931","text":"5. reflexive (entrenched ring-0)"}]},{"id":"blk-63821","spans":[{"id":"spn-93932","text":"— (no self-amendment